%H A175531 Everett W. Howe, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1090/S0025-5718-00-01225-4">Higher-order Carmichael numbers</a>, Math. Comp. 69 (2000), 1711-1719. doi:10.1090/S0025-5718-00-01225-4
%H A175531 J C Puddefoot, <a href="https://github.com/pudepiedj/carmichael-order2-census">Complete census of Carmichael numbers of order 2 below 10^25</a>, GitHub, 2026.
